<div n="1" type="jAnnouncements">             <div n="2" type="jAn">                <head>                   <hi rendition="#b">Zur Beachtung.</hi>                </head>                <lb/>
<p>Wir machen un&#x017F;ere <hi rendition="#aq">P. T.</hi> Abonnenten, welche<lb/>
